{
  "id": "docker",
  "name": "Docker / Compose",
  "description": "Docker / Compose 的研发配置、工具与依赖读取候选。",
  "verification": {
    "level": "documentation",
    "toolVersions": [
      "Docker CLI current"
    ],
    "checkedAt": "2026-10-03"
  },
  "notes": [
    "配置根可含 auths、context 证书和认证；credential helper 的权限不是目录权限。",
    "daemon/socket 可操作沙箱外资源；选择此模板不授予连接 daemon、build/run/push/login 或网络许可。"
  ],
  "platforms": {
    "darwin": {
      "readable": [
        {
          "id": "config",
          "path": "~/.docker",
          "targetType": "directory",
          "description": "Docker / Compose：用户配置读取，可能包含认证参数或外部文件引用。",
          "containsCredentials": true,
          "sources": [
            "https://docs.docker.com/reference/cli/docker/"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "custom-config",
          "path": "${DOCKER_CONFIG}",
          "targetType": "directory",
